# Shared UI modules

## Buttons

All dashboard / admin / hub action buttons MUST use:

```ts
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
```

Variants (do not invent `bg-emerald-600` / `bg-red-600` overrides):

| Use | Variant |
|-----|---------|
| Primary action | `default` |
| Secondary / cancel / refresh | `outline` |
| Positive confirm (start, create, save green) | `success` |
| Warning | `warning` |
| Hard destructive CTA | `danger` |
| Soft destructive | `destructive` |
| Icon only | `ghost` + `size="icon-sm"` |
| Filter chips | `chip` idle, `success` selected |

**Exceptions:** POS shell (`pos-overlay`, POS panels with `--pos-*` tokens) and print/receipt HTML may keep local controls.

## Tables

List / data grids MUST use:

```ts
import { ClientSideTable, DataTableColumnHeader, TableActionsRow, OpenRecordButton } from "@/components/table";
```

**Exceptions:** print statements, receipt HTML, POS cart line editors, financial statement layouts.
